# tests/, vitest.config.ts and tsconfig.typecheck.json are TRACKED since
# 0.8.9: the suite is the project's regression asset and must sync across
# the two dev machines through git (they were local-only 2026-10-31..11-04,
# which is how the two sides drifted). tsconfig.typecheck.json carries
# per-machine absolute path candidates (D:/… first, /home/… second) — both
